A.aHT=s(["Clean the bed with isopropyl alcohol and let it evaporate.","Heat the bed and nozzle to the normal temperature for the material.","Run manual or auto leveling and check Z offset with a first-layer test.","The line should be slightly squished: not round, not scraping the bed."],t.s)
A.b2j=new B.bJ(A.bc,"CALIBRATION","Stable first layer","Set bed, nozzle and distance before printing.",A.aHT,"If the nozzle touches the bed, stop and raise Z offset gradually to avoid scratching it.",A.k5,A.ay,null,null)
A.aHG=s(["Heat the nozzle to the loaded filament temperature.","Remove the filament carefully and trim the deformed tip.","Use a cleaning needle through the nozzle without forcing it.","Push fresh filament until flow is continuous and bubble-free.","Brush the outside of the hot nozzle with a soft metal brush."],t.s)
