A.b2S=new B.bJ(A.bc,"QUALITY","Too much stringing","Diagnose moisture, temperature and retraction.",A.aIC,"Materials dry at different temperatures. Check the manufacturer recommendation.",A.po,A.cU,"View recommended dryer","https://meli.la/2HAJTJP")
A.aGi=s(["Make sure the bed is clean and grease-free.","Check that the first layer is not too high.","Use a brim when the part has a small base or large corners.","If your bed surface allows it, apply a light layer of 3D printing adhesive. Tenkai recommends keeping an adhesive glue ready for difficult parts.","Check that bed temperature is suitable for your material.","Avoid strong drafts near the printer.","Use a small amount: a thin layer usually works better than flooding the bed."],t.s)
A.b2F=new B.bJ(A.bc,"ADHESION","Part lifting from bed","Improve adhesion without damaging the bed.",A.aGi,"Do not pry stuck parts with a sharp tool toward your hand. Let the bed cool first.",A.ph,A.bG,"View recommended glue","https://meli.la/2oHmo2j")
A.aGx=s(["Check that filament feeds freely and is not chewed by the extruder.","Clean or replace the nozzle if flow is thin or intermittent.","Increase temperature in 5 degree steps if the material struggles to flow.","Verify that slicer filament diameter matches your real filament, usually 1.75 mm.","Reduce print speed if the hotend cannot melt material fast enough."],t.s)
