A.GE=new B.a_(A.H4,["Support Tenkai","Support Tenkai","Help improve Tenkai","Every contribution helps us keep improving the app and unlocks more slots for filaments, resins, extras, clients, and machines.","It also helps us create new free apps and affordable paid tools, keeping useful technology accessible and beneficial to everyone. Thank you for supporting this small business.","Small support","Medium support","Large support","Extraordinary support","Bronze Rank \xb7 10 supplies \xb7 15 clients \xb7 2 machines","Silver Rank \xb7 15 supplies \xb7 20 clients \xb7 3 machines","Gold Rank \xb7 20 supplies \xb7 25 clients \xb7 4 machines","Diamond Rank \xb7 unlimited","Purchases are not enabled yet.","Coming soon","Support","Unavailable","Restore purchases","Restoring purchases...","Purchases restored successfully.","No previous purchases were found on this account.","Google Play could not be reached.","Purchase protected and managed by Google Play."],t.w)
